model c3_rule_window
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247, ruling 13, C12 (b)): `window(e1, e2)` computed in a rule of a `date` def sits in that cell: the cell names the unknown day, its listed readers read it by the ends, and a `with` pin of the cell gives the pinned day (`pinned:`, L §4.4, §8.2). Written at C2, stored at the third pin."
source s "invented"
input d0: date
input d9: date
input n4: int
def wd: date
  rule base = window(d0, add_days(d0, n4))
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  d0 = 2026-03-30 "s"
  d9 = 2026-04-10 "s"
  n4 = 4 "s"
ask stretch: wd
ask month: month_of(wd)
ask year: year_of(wd)
ask before: wd < d9
ask off: weekday(wd)
ask pinned: month_of(wd) with wd = 2026-04-02
ask pinned_off: weekday(wd) with wd = 2026-04-02
